│   //! A4: Phụ thu check-in sớm (Early check-in surcharge)                    │
│   //! A5: Phụ thu check-out muộn (Late check-out surcharge)                  │
│                                                                              │
│   use chrono::{NaiveDate, NaiveDateTime, NaiveTime};                         │
